  lines:
  - speaker: Police
    text: yup, it checks out, he is the one.
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Police
    text: fingerprint matches, bloody knife fingerprint also matches
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: so he lied before..
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Police
    text: yeah.. thanks for the journal tho.. the victim would've been happy that
      the truth unveils itself at the very end because of his work
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3584525341705306422, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
  - speaker: Player
    text: yeah.. too bad he's not here to see this..
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 3425749645153845377, guid: ac50471ca89a74434a48e415d7b77f9d,
      type: 3}
